Bruce Springsteen.

00:05:15.881 --> 00:05:19.018
Bruce! Are you there?

00:05:19.018 --> 00:05:21.587
-Yeah, hey, Jimmy.
Going down to the --

00:05:21.587 --> 00:05:24.991
[ Incoherent mumbling ]

00:05:24.991 --> 00:05:26.792
-Thanks for being here.

00:05:26.792 --> 00:05:29.996
What do you think about weed
being legal in Jersey?

00:05:29.996 --> 00:05:34.200
-Yeah, you know...
[ Incoherent mumbling ]

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:37.636
-[ Laughter ]
-That's great.

00:05:37.636 --> 00:05:40.639
I saw that you have a podcast
with President Obama.

00:05:40.639 --> 00:05:42.007
How's that going?

00:05:42.007 --> 00:05:46.279
-Yeah, it's going real good.
[ Incoherent mumbling ]

00:05:46.279 --> 00:05:48.881
You should, uh, buy a Jeep!

00:05:48.881 --> 00:05:53.185
-Really? You have
special guests, you say?

00:05:53.185 --> 00:05:54.720
Like who? Who's --

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:58.558
-[ Incoherent mumbling ]

00:05:58.558 --> 00:06:01.861
-Wow. It's Bob Dylan.
Bob, how's it going?

00:06:01.861 --> 00:06:04.497
-[ Bob Dylan
mumbling incoherently ]

00:06:04.497 --> 00:06:06.866
[ Bruce Springsteen
mumbling incoherently ]

00:06:06.866 --> 00:06:08.767
-[ Bob Dylan
mumbling incoherently ]

00:06:08.767 --> 00:06:13.071
[ Both mumbling incoherently ]

00:06:13.071 --> 00:06:15.374
-[ Chuckles ] Well, do you guys

00:06:15.374 --> 00:06:18.711
have any final thoughts
about weed being legal?

00:06:18.711 --> 00:06:20.680
[ Both laughing ]

00:06:24.817 --> 00:06:27.453
-Laughing Bob Dylan and
Bruce Springsteen, everybody.

00:06:27.453 --> 00:06:31.390
Thanks. Amazing that
we got them on the line.

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:33.291
Some local news.

00:06:33.291 --> 00:06:35.928
I read that yesterday
a thief here in New York City

00:06:35.928 --> 00:06:40.066
